# Arms of the player's air states that no play ran: PlayerFlung (81:DA14),
# PlayerSprung (81:D8FD), PlayerHeldJumpOff (81:D5EC) and PlayerHeld
# (81:D6F8). Each state is entered at its own entry: by the game (kind
# $7B flings him, kind $79 holds him) or with his code set to the entry
# (the record's P, PC at $08DD), as the actor loop resumes it.
# 1-3. Kind $7B flings him as in cov_kind7b.box part 1 (level $0A); its
#    air loop runs from 37 frames after he is dropped on it.
#    1. A at frame 39: a throw starts (81:DA74), AIR_THROW counts down to
#       0 in the air (81:DA60-DA6E).
#    2. HOVER_ON ($036E) 1 and R held while he falls: on at PlayerHover
#       (81:DA8E-DA99).
#    3. RIGHT held 20 frames: he drifts off it onto the ground at y $00F8
#       (81:DACB, on at PlayerLand).
# 4-6. Level 4 as cov_hover.box part 5, to the jump toward the ledge whose
#    corner is at x $0220, y $0170 (the wall below it at x $021A; its top
#    at y $0158). Each flight comes down the wall's face below its top
#    and he catches the ledge (on at PlayerLedgeGrab, then hanging at x
#    $0221, y $0171):
#    4. 26 frames into the jump (x $01FC, y $014F) his code is set to
#       PlayerFlung; RIGHT 10 frames from its air loop, then from frame 62
#       (81:DABD).
#    5. The same with PlayerSprung, RIGHT 16 frames from frame 27 and from
#       frame 54 (81:D986).
#    6. PlayerSprung with HOVER_ON 1 and R held: on at PlayerHover once he
#       falls (81:D957-D962).
#    7. Standing at x $01DF, y $0188 (before the jump), his code set to
#       PlayerHeld with its saved position ($145D) his own; his hold pose
#       ($2F) reaches 4 after 30 frames; at 44, B jumps him off
#       (PlayerHeldJumpOff) and RIGHT takes him onto the ledge (81:D6E1).
# 8. Level 5 (stage a1 s1, as cov_knockback_level5.box to its walk off the
#    ledge), standing at x $021B, y $01A5: the same jump off; he falls
#    into the ground with tile behaviour bit 4 behind from y $01DC down
#    (81:D6BD-D6CE: V_1A10 and V_1A12 set).
# 9. Kind $79 holds him as in cov_held_jump_off.box part A, with the
#    copier RAM on (cartram): the copier mark reads back and he is held for
#    good (81:D72E).
